☰
</button>

</div>


<div class="mobile-menu" id="mobileMenu">

<a href="#home" onclick="closeMenu()">Home</a>
<a href="#safaris" onclick="closeMenu()">Safaris</a>
<a href="#destinations" onclick="closeMenu()">Destinations</a>
<a href="#kilimanjaro" onclick="closeMenu()">Kilimanjaro</a>
<a href="#zanzibar" onclick="closeMenu()">Zanzibar</a>
<a href="#honeymoon" onclick="closeMenu()">Honeymoon</a>
<a href="#b2b" onclick="closeMenu()">B2B</a>
<a href="#contact" onclick="closeMenu()">Contact</a>

<a href="#contact" class="btn btn-gold" onclick="closeMenu()">
BOOK NOW
</a>

</div>

</header>



<!-- HERO -->

<section class="hero" id="home">

<div class="container">

<div class="hero-content">

<span class="eyebrow">
EAST AFRICA DMC
</span>

<h1>
When Wild Calls Your Name.
</h1>

<p>
Tailor-made safaris, Kilimanjaro adventures,
Zanzibar escapes and unforgettable journeys
across Tanzania, Kenya, Uganda, Rwanda
and Burundi.
</p>


<div class="buttons">

<a href="#contact" class="btn btn-gold">
PLAN YOUR ADVENTURE
</a>

<a href="#destinations" class="btn btn-light">
EXPLORE DESTINATIONS
</a>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>



<!-- INTRO -->

<section class="section">

<div class="container">

<div class="section-title">

<span class="eyebrow">
AVALIA ADVENTURE
</span>

<h2>
East Africa, designed around you.
</h2>

<p>
We create private and tailor-made journeys
for travellers, families, honeymooners and
travel partners looking to experience East
Africa with trusted local expertise.
</p>

</div>

</div>

</section>



<!-- SAFARIS -->

<section class="section cream" id="safaris">

<div class="container">

<div class="section-title">

<span class="eyebrow">
SAFARIS
</span>

<h2>
Wildlife journeys<br>
worth remembering.
</h2>

<p>
From the Serengeti and Ngorongoro to Kenya's
iconic parks and Uganda's wildlife landscapes,
we design safari experiences around your style,
dates and budget.
</p>

</div>


<div class="grid">

<div class="card">

<div class="card-image tanzania"></div>

<div class="card-body">

<span>TANZANIA</span>

<h3>
Northern Circuit Safari
</h3>

<p>
Tarangire • Ngorongoro • Serengeti
</p>

<a href="#contact">
PLAN TANZANIA →
</a>

</div>

</div>


<div class="card">

<div class="card-image kenya"></div>

<div class="card-body">

<span>KENYA</span>

<h3>
Kenya Safari
</h3>

<p>
Masai Mara • Amboseli • Tsavo
</p>

<a href="#contact">
PLAN KENYA →
</a>

</div>

</div>


<div class="card">

<div class="card-image uganda"></div>

<div class="card-body">

<span>UGANDA</span>

<h3>
Gorilla & Wildlife
</h3>

<p>
Bwindi • Queen Elizabeth • Kibale
</p>

<a href="#contact">
PLAN UGANDA →
</a>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>



<!-- DESTINATIONS -->

<section class="section" id="destinations">

<div class="container">

<div class="section-title">

<span class="eyebrow">
DESTINATIONS
</span>

<h2>
Five countries.<br>
One East African adventure.
</h2>

</div>


<div class="grid">

<div class="card">

<div class="card-image tanzania"></div>

<div class="card-body">

<span>01</span>

<h3>Tanzania</h3>

<p>
Safari, Kilimanjaro, Zanzibar and
